    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ULTIMATE TRAMPOLINE GAME now on Steam!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the trampoline with Frontflips, Backflips, Gainers, Layouts, jump and bounce on your backyard, gym or circus trampolines and train to be the Master of Trampoline! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a custom physics engine and animated Ragdoll Physics, Flip Master is the most dynamic and entertaining Trampoline experience ever created! Defy the laws of physics and prove yourself worthy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Flip Master to your cart NOW and get:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS TRAMPOLINES, LEGENDARY SPOTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your trampoline! Backyard, gym, competition trampoline, circus, and trampoline parks with multiple trampolines \u2013 or bounce in the mountains, lava city, castles, rivers, slopes, cliffs, even rooftop trampolines! So many wild spots and trampolines to discover! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILLS AND TRICKS TO UNLOCK!</strong>  <br>Unlock dangerous and spectacular skills! Backflips, Frontflips, Gainers and 10 more tricks at the palm of your hand!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAD MINIGAMES</strong>  <br>Wind Tunnel: Float &amp; Flip in our Vertical Wind tunnel! Soar high, collect coins and kick beachballs!  <br>Human Fortuna: Blast &amp; propel your characters though massive human Fortuna and land on unbeatable hi-score!  <br>Cannon Shoot: Catapult out from giant cannon, thrive on trampoline bounces and land on an air filled mattress!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAZY POWER UPS!</strong>  <br>Power-up Frenzy! A huge amount of power-ups to choose from! Select the medicine ball or the Foam cube and get the jumping party started! Even More - go to a gold rush with the Coin Rain powerup and much more!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMAZING CHARACTERS!</strong>  <br>Chose, upgrade and customize your characters. Jump as an athlete and reach amazing heights! Every character has their own unique physics! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game also includes full support for all gamepads &amp; Steam Deck!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ULTIMATE TRAMPOLINE GAME now on Steam!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the trampoline with Frontflips, Backflips, Gainers, Layouts, jump and bounce on your backyard, gym or circus trampolines and train to be the Master of Trampoline! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a custom physics engine and animated Ragdoll Physics, Flip Master is the most dynamic and entertaining Trampoline experience ever created! Defy the laws of physics and prove yourself worthy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Flip Master to your cart NOW and get:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDLESS TRAMPOLINES, LEGENDARY SPOTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your trampoline! Backyard, gym, competition trampoline, circus, and trampoline parks with multiple trampolines \u2013 or bounce in the mountains, lava city, castles, rivers, slopes, cliffs, even rooftop trampolines! So many wild spots and trampolines to discover! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILLS AND TRICKS TO UNLOCK!</strong>  <br>Unlock dangerous and spectacular skills! Backflips, Frontflips, Gainers and 10 more tricks at the palm of your hand!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAD MINIGAMES</strong>  <br>Wind Tunnel: Float &amp; Flip in our Vertical Wind tunnel! Soar high, collect coins and kick beachballs!  <br>Human Fortuna: Blast &amp; propel your characters though massive human Fortuna and land on unbeatable hi-score!  <br>Cannon Shoot: Catapult out from giant cannon, thrive on trampoline bounces and land on an air filled mattress!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAZY POWER UPS!</strong>  <br>Power-up Frenzy! A huge amount of power-ups to choose from! Select the medicine ball or the Foam cube and get the jumping party started! Even More - go to a gold rush with the Coin Rain powerup and much more!   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AMAZING CHARACTERS!</strong>  <br>Chose, upgrade and customize your characters. Jump as an athlete and reach amazing heights! Every character has their own unique physics! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game also includes full support for all gamepads &amp; Steam Deck!</p>",
    "short_description": "The ULTIMATE TRAMPOLINE GAME now on Steam! Master the trampolines with Frontflips, Backflips, Gainers &amp; Layouts! With a custom animated Ragdoll Physics engine, Flip Master is the most dynamic and entertaining Trampoline experience ever created! Defy the laws of physics!",
